  "description": "Jump into fast-paced racing action and take control of powerful race cars on exciting tracks.\n\nIn Apex 2026: Rise of Legends, every race is about skill, timing, and quick decisions. Learn the tracks, improve your driving, and compete against challenging AI opponents.\n\nWhether you want quick races or a full career experience, the action never stops.\n\nFEATURES\nEasy to learn, skill-based driving\nFast and exciting races on multiple tracks\nCareer Mode and Quick Race\nCompetitive AI opponents\nDynamic camera views and smooth controls\nFIX YOUR MISTAKES\n\nMade a mistake? Keep going.\n\nUse the Rewind system to go back in time, correct your errors, and try again — perfect for learning tracks and improving your skills.\n\nRACE YOUR WAY\n\nWin races, improve your performance, and climb the ranks to become a true racing legend.",
